en, Shi-Hung Tsai, Chih-Chien Sung, Chien-Chou Chen, Yu-Juei Hsu, Yi-Jen Hung, Shih-Hua Lin. AI-enabled electrocardiogram alert for potassium imbalance treatment: a pragmatic randomized controlled trial. Nat Commun. 2026;17(1):159. DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-66394-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">10.1038/s41467-025-66394-4</a>. <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41507124/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PubMed</a>. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-66394-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vydavateľ</a>.</em></small></li><li><small><em>Baldeep Kaur, Guntas Singh Gill, Kiranpreet Kaur, Ankur Chaudhary, Ashutosh Garg. Artificial Intelligence-Enabled Electrocardiography for Potassium Abnormality Detection and Estimation: A Systematic Review. Cureus. 2026;18(7):e113226. DOI: <a href="https://doi.org/10.7759/cureus.113226" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">10.7759/cureus.113226</a>. <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42633279/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PubMed</a>. <a href="https://doi.org/10.7759/cureus.113226" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vydavateľ</a>.</em></small></li></ol>
